# Stack And Data Rules

- This repo is a Next.js App Router frontend with TypeScript and Tailwind v4.
- Prefer Server Components by default. Add `'use client'` only for hooks, event handlers, browser APIs, or GSAP animation code.
- Fetch WordPress data only through `fetchGraphQL<T>` in `lib/graphql-client.ts`.
- Define GraphQL query strings only in `lib/queries.ts`. Do not inline GraphQL queries in pages or components.
- Keep GraphQL response types in `lib/types.ts`.
- Use the server-only `WORDPRESS_API_URL` environment variable. Do not introduce `NEXT_PUBLIC_WORDPRESS_API_URL`.
- Use single quotes and omit semicolons.
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes and avoid arbitrary values unless they are clearly necessary.
